Removes DHCP option 6. SoftAP has no DNS server.

Without this patch: SILENT. Clients flood UDP 53; the ICMP replies exhaust SDPCM TX credits and all outgoing TCP stalls.

Asset:    lwip-network-interface-integration release-v1.7.1
File:     source/cy_lwip_dhcp_server.c
Upstream: N/A — local to BENTO, not submitted upstream

